      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00190",
        "explanation": "The doctor provided an executable interim contingency list and confirmed the caregiver's planned questions.",
        "quote": "这三项能覆盖当前最核心的感染风险评估"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00204",
        "explanation": "The final observed event remained an unanswered caregiver confirmation request, so closure is not a fully clinician-closed loop.",
        "quote": "是不是就按这个边界来"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The episode had a mostly executable plan: continue medicines, observe red flags, and attend transplant follow-up with infection/hepatitis/TB questions. It is only a questionable open closure because the last caregiver message asked for confirmation and because earlier minor safety/framing gaps were not fully repaired by a final clinician response.",
